{{missing info|other unused designs in both pre-release and final builds of the games.}}
[[File:MCSM Unused mobs preview.png|thumb|class=drop-shadow-light|Some of the mobs that were never seen in the games]]
Since the beginning of the development of {{MCSM}} and ''[[Minecraft: Story Mode - Season Two]]'', there have been several assets of '''unused and removed features''' that were never seen in the finished versions of the game. These features may have been replaced, or a developer decided against the feature later on.

Some of these are still in the current versions' files but most of them only exist in pre-release builds of {{SMEp|7}} and {{SMEp|4|2}} that were pushed to public branches of the games on Steam. These builds can be accessed by users who own the game via the Steam Console, maintained by Valve, or through third-party tools like DepotDownloader.<ref>{{citation
| url = https://tcrf.net/Proto:Minecraft:_Story_Mode:_Season_Two/Unfinished_204_Build
| title = Proto:Minecraft: Story Mode: Season Two/Unfinished 204 Build
| website = [https://tcrf.net/The_Cutting_Room_Floor The Cutting Room Floor Wiki]
| date = July 29, 2024
| quote = On September 13th, 2017, a pre-release build of Episode 4 was pushed into the public Episode 4 PC branch.
}}</ref><ref>{{ytl|6EF_9Py6M78|Minecraft Story Mode S2E4 - UNFINISHED DEVELOPER BUILD (Part 1) Telltale Games|Story-Based Games Videos|Feb 20, 2021}}. "DISCLAIMER: This episode was obtained legally. By using Steam Depot Downloader..."</ref>

