=== Prismarine creeper ===
A prismarine variant of the {{MCSM|creeper}} that went unused in ''Minecraft: Story Mode''. The assets still exist in the files of ''Hero in Residence''. They were meant to come from the {{MCSM|Heckmouth}} in ''Hero in Residence''. They were ultimately scrapped and replaced instead by charged creepers to keep prismarine mobs exclusive in the {{MCSM|Sea Temple}}.<ref name=prismarine>{{Tumblr|stirpicus|166796024956|Oh man someone found those?! I absolutely loved them. They had little tentacle faces so we nicknamed them “Cthulu Creepers.”|October 25, 2017}}</ref>

Like the [[Story Mode:Prismarine Soldier|soldiers]] and the [[Story Mode:Prismarine Colossus|colossi]], the prismarine creeper's design took inspiration from {{Wikipedia|Cthulhu}}. The development team nicknamed the prismarine creepers as "Cthulu Creepers" due to their appearance.

<gallery>
Prismarine Creeper.png|An isometric render of the prismarine creeper
Prismarine creepers720p.mp4|Prismarine creepers in-game, replacing the creeper model
</gallery>

