== Plotline ==

=== Reuben Lives ===
[[File:MCSM Reuben Lives.png|thumb|Reuben at the Beacon Ceremony]]
Reuben was planned to have survived from the wither storm in the Netflix version, and to have him accompany Jesse's gang through the portal hallway, but it was ultimately cancelled due to the closure of Telltale Games.<ref>{{tumblr|stirpicus|700247111657242624|So, in honor of the Netflix edition of Minecraft: Story Mode officially leaving the service, I wanted to share this screenshot that someone smuggled out from behind the scenes while the team was making it...|November 7, 2022}}</ref>
